  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "The next day I woke up and all my clothes had been shredded. Clearly I was mistaken to trust my peers. Their facade is just that; a false friendship masking severe competitiveness. Well, if that's how they're going to play it, I can play rough too. I was not going to fall back on my family's money, but needs must...",
    "value": "翌日醒来，我所有的衣物皆被撕毁。显然，我错信了我的同侪。他们的友善不过是层表象；虚伪的友谊之下，掩藏着极重的竞争之心。好吧，既然他们选择如此游戏，我亦能奉陪到底。我本不愿倚仗家中钱财，但情势所迫..."
